    "excerpt": "Modern healthcare depends on more than experienced doctors. Advanced medical technology plays an important role in detecting health conditions, supporting treatment decisions, monitoring patients, and performing complex procedures. For a multispecialty hospital, access to appropriate diagnostic and treatment technologies can help create a more comprehensive healthcare environment.",
