    "excerpt": "Undergoing surgery is an important healthcare decision. Whether it is a planned procedure or treatment recommended after a medical emergency, choosing the right hospital can influence the overall treatment experience. Patients and families often consider factors such as surgical expertise, hospital infrastructure, diagnostic facilities, emergency support, technology, and post-operative care.",
    "category": "Surgical Care",
